      "content": "but it doesn't feel like that. i'm not helping them, i'm just costing them. every dollar i spend on rent or food is a dollar they could have used if i wasn't here dragging them down. i've actually sat here for an hour doing the math... if i wasn't part of the equation, things would actually start to move forward for them. it's just math at this point.",
